WEBVTT

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:22.590
Thanks to Mepple and Mipple who ran away 
from the Field of Light with the Prism Stones,

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:28.140
we're stuck with fighting 
these outrageous creatures.

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:34.910
In any case, it's our duty 
to protect those two.

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:43.080
I wish you'd let me enjoy 
a normal school life.

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:44.860
Misumi-san?

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:46.280
Yes? It's impossible.

00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:47.360
What is?

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:52.490
You're in charge of the 
social studies field trip,

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:54.520
so you can't walk around in a daze.

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:57.740
Good morning.

00:00:58.170 --> 00:01:01.520
Are you coming , too, Principal?

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:06.290
Yes.  I thought it would be nice to go along 
with the students to the art museum for a change.

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:09.000
It's not something you can do very often.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.010
Shall we go?

00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:18.200
Misumi-san, work with Yukishiro-san 
and keep all the students together.

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:19.380
Let's do our best.

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:21.590
I wonder what's going to happen.

00:01:22.360 --> 00:01:24.960
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:30.600
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:34.870
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:34.870 --> 00:01:37.840
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:40.710
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:42.610
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:43.820 --> 00:01:46.520
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:48.120
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:53.930
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:56.030
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:56.030 --> 00:01:59.800
<i>and closer</i>

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:03.800
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:06.370
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:09.540
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:12.410
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:12.410 --> 00:02:18.680
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:19.580
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:22.290
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:25.090
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:27.990
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:29.560
<i>Together we are</i>

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:32.630
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:45.720
The art museum we're going to today 
has exhibits by Leonardo da Vinci,

00:02:46.030 --> 00:02:52.510
Monet, Degas, Renoir and 
many other famous artists.

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:55.220
Look! Look at this!

00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:59.190
The wording was all done by Yukishiro-san, 
and Nagisa did all the drawings.

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.660
How cute.

00:03:02.520 --> 00:03:04.380
Be quiet over there!

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:11.270
Aside from that, there are 
sculptures and other exhibits,

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:13.050
so please enjoy them all.

00:03:13.050 --> 00:03:14.120
Excuse me...

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:15.710
What is it?

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:21.390
It can't be compare to da 
Vinci, but there's a painting

00:03:21.390 --> 00:03:24.340
by my favorite artist, Mario Piccarini

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:27.100
that I hope you'll all go to see.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:28.150
Piccarini?

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:30.680
His painting, "Stardust Dinner Party,"

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:32.790
is a really amazing painting

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:36.130
and this is the first time it's 
being exhibited here in Japan.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:39.330
Just what you'd expect from 
someone in the art club...

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:40.570
You know a lot, don't you?

00:03:40.850 --> 00:03:44.970
Piccarini was an Italian 
artist about 100 years ago...

00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:47.110
He was the third son of a poor farmer.

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:51.320
He wasn't as handy around the 
farm as his two older brothers,

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:56.010
so he continued painting while he helped out 
in the fields until he was finally recognized.

00:03:56.430 --> 00:03:59.480
That simple background is what I really love.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:02.060
That's awesome! That's so awesome!

00:04:02.060 --> 00:04:04.150
She put the Queen of Knowledge to shame.

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:05.350
Huh?

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:08.790
I didn't mean to... It's 
just that I love art.

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:11.670
Did you change your hairstyle?

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:15.330
A little.

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:19.930
Doesn't it look a little bit like Nagisa's?

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:24.660
Now that you mention it...

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:25.910
It does look a little bit like mine.

00:04:26.810 --> 00:04:29.210
The truth is... I did copy your hairstyle.

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:31.910
I've always thought you were cool,

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:34.930
so I wanted to at least 
share the same hairstyle.

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:37.890
I'm sorry if it upsets you.

00:04:37.890 --> 00:04:39.180
Not at all!

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:41.440
It looks much better on you.

00:04:42.020 --> 00:04:43.860
It's really cute, Kashiwada-san.

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:46.060
Thank you.

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:47.470
That girl...?

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:49.410
Mayu Kashiwada?

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:53.280
When she first came to our school, 
she was plain and gloomy, wasn't she?

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:57.470
Yes, but every since she joined 
the art club, she's blossomed.

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:00.170
I'm so glad.

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:14.160
"A MIRACLE? 
THE ART MUSEUM COMES TO LIFE!"

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:19.680
I won't allow any more failures!

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:24.880
Be sure you bring back the Prism Stones!

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:28.330
Otherwise, you're dead.

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:35.540
If you can't do it, than just say so.

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:40.190
It's for your own sake...

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:42.580
No matter how many times you go, 
the results are always the same.

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:43.930
What?

00:05:46.690 --> 00:05:49.380
I don't know what you're up against,

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:51.720
but they're not quite up 
to our level, are they?

00:05:51.970 --> 00:05:54.210
Kiriya! Don't get carried away.

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:57.850
You've been given another chance...

00:05:57.850 --> 00:05:59.930
Put your life on the line, and go.

00:06:11.160 --> 00:06:13.110
It's so beautiful!

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:16.560
Wow! Look at the man in this painting!

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:18.700
Isn't he handsome?

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:20.220
You can't go there!

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:22.890
There's a set route you 
have to follow in a museum.

00:06:23.370 --> 00:06:25.690
Be sure to follow the signs!

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:27.670
All right.

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:30.200
This painting is the work 
of the French impressionist,

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:33.130
Degas who was known for his work 
called "The Dancer," isn't it?

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:37.790
What kind of style is the painting?

00:06:38.360 --> 00:06:40.050
What kind of person was the artist?

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:42.470
I need some time to...

00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:43.960
Hey!

00:06:45.910 --> 00:06:46.920
Whose voice is that?

00:06:47.270 --> 00:06:49.220
Hey!

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:56.380
Hey, Ms. Yoshimi!

00:06:57.030 --> 00:06:58.800
I'll leave the rest to you, Mayu!

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:17.830
Didn't I tell you not to start 
talking all of a sudden like that?

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:20.040
I want to be with Mipple mepo.

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:23.010
You can't! I'm letting you stay up today,

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:25.860
but you promised to be quiet, didn't you?

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:29.790
Let me see her mepo... Or 
I'm going to yell mepo.

00:07:33.990 --> 00:07:36.170
What are you doing Misumi-san?

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:38.130
Mipple!

00:07:38.840 --> 00:07:39.570
Mepple!

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:44.940
Mipple...!

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:46.470
Mepple...!

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:48.680
You can't do that here.

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:54.820
Listen here, there are a 
lot of fragile items here,

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:56.540
so you're not allowed to go off on your own.

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:02.890
Where are all the fragile items mepo?

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:04.590
They're all fragile!

00:08:04.590 --> 00:08:09.230
For example, this sculpture may 
look hard, but it's really very...

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:14.680
Oh my gosh!

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:16.090
Be careful!

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:19.310
What am I going to do?

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.610
What should I do?

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:23.970
Good grief! I never know what's 
going to happen when I'm with you.

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:26.630
Never mind that, and help me.

00:08:26.890 --> 00:08:28.490
I have to do something.

00:08:30.770 --> 00:08:32.690
All right! It's stuck back on again.

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:43.490
It looks strange.

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:45.100
Never mind.

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:48.350
What's wrong mepo?

00:08:48.350 --> 00:08:50.020
I want to go over there mipo.

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:56.210
This is the painting mipo.

00:08:56.740 --> 00:08:58.180
What about this painting?

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:00.700
I don't know what it is,

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:03.990
but it gives me a really 
nostalgic feeling mipo.

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:08.450
By any chance, is this...?

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:12.100
It's Mipple mepo.

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:13.970
It can't be!

00:09:13.970 --> 00:09:18.100
Look right here... It says 
it was done in 1904...

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:18.100
Mario Piccarini

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:22.400
Why is Mipple in a painting 
that was done 100 years ago?

00:09:23.130 --> 00:09:24.560
A hundred years ago...

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:33.020
Now that you mention it,

00:09:33.020 --> 00:09:36.480
I have a feeling I came to this 
Field of Rainbows a long time ago.

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:38.300
A long time ago?

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:43.610
And I fell somewhere really far away...

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:47.740
And for a long time, I went here and there,

00:09:47.740 --> 00:09:51.420
and traveled to different places...

00:09:52.470 --> 00:09:56.510
When I opened my eyes, I was 
inside Honoka's storeroom.

00:09:57.770 --> 00:10:02.030
You mean Mepple escaped 100 years later?

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:03.920
The way you're always 
wanting to be with Mipple,

00:10:03.920 --> 00:10:05.980
I'm surprised you had that much patience.

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:10.680
I went after Mipple the very next day mepo.

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:13.970
The next day? How could that be?

00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:18.410
The Senior once told me mipo...

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:19.910
That when you go to another world,

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:22.520
the passage of time is different mipo.

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:25.500
Then how old are you two anyway?

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:32.670
This has often been the subject 
of research for a long time now.

00:10:46.190 --> 00:10:48.310
Misumi-san...?  Yukishiro-san?

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:53.690
I wondered where you two went...

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:55.900
It's Piccarini!

00:10:56.190 --> 00:11:00.660
So this is the painting that 
you were talking about.

00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:04.660
And this is a self-portrait of Piccarini.

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:09.070
So this is Piccarini...

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:12.390
He wasn't good in school, 
and he was sickly, too.

00:11:12.390 --> 00:11:14.290
No matter what he did when he was a child,

00:11:14.290 --> 00:11:17.080
he was never very impressive.

00:11:18.430 --> 00:11:21.820
That day, he had a frustrating day at school,

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:23.910
so he was looking up at 
the stars that night...

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:34.640
Shooting star... Please grant 
my wish to have talent.

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:54.410
That hurt!

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:06.280
From the morning after he 
picked up that shooting star,

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:09.000
he put his heart and soul into his paintings,

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:12.440
and before he knew it, he 
was a world renown artist.

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:14.420
You really know a lot about him, don't you?

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:16.430
I really love his paintings,

00:12:16.430 --> 00:12:18.880
so I read a lot of books 
to learn more about him.

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:22.210
It's important to believe in yourself,

00:12:22.210 --> 00:12:24.100
and when I look at Piccarini's paintings,

00:12:24.100 --> 00:12:26.360
It seems to give me courage.

00:12:53.010 --> 00:12:54.760
You haven't forgotten anything, have you?

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:56.710
Hey! Wait a minute!

00:12:57.010 --> 00:12:58.160
What's wrong?

00:12:58.160 --> 00:12:59.670
Mayu's not here.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.020
You're right!

00:13:01.470 --> 00:13:03.670
Is she still inside?

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:06.680
The principal and vice 
principal aren't here either.

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:25.880
So those two aren't here.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:35.330
We'd better be going, Principal.

00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:39.290
Art makes you forget the time, doesn't it?

00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:42.250
She's probably by the painting.

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:48.030
What's going on?

00:13:50.420 --> 00:13:52.050
Hurry, Kometsuki!

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:04.910
Aren't there a lot of 
stone statues around here?

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:08.420
You're right! That one over there looks 
exactly like the school principal.

00:14:08.670 --> 00:14:10.050
Look carefully mepo.

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:11.890
These aren't ordinary stone statues mepo.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.040
This is...!

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:25.300
I sense evil lurking nearby mepo.

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:30.490
There she is!

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:32.430
Prepare yourself!

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:40.290
Mayu!

00:14:40.640 --> 00:14:42.010
Kashiwada-san!

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:44.530
It's you again!

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:47.440
What did you do to Mayu?

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:49.160
Bring Kashiwada-san back!

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:50.840
Be quiet!

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:52.340
Zakenna!

00:14:52.340 --> 00:14:56.040
Show them the terror of your sinister 
heart and the power of darkness!

00:15:18.740 --> 00:15:20.400
You're kidding!

00:15:30.510 --> 00:15:31.930
What's going on?

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:39.050
Hurry, and transform mepo!

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:42.920
It's impossible!

00:15:53.020 --> 00:15:54.300
Now mepo!

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:09.660
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:17:01.470 --> 00:17:03.830
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:06.700
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:10.570
Together, we are Pretty Cure!

00:17:12.020 --> 00:17:14.180
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:17:15.140 --> 00:17:17.410
Go back to where you came from!

00:17:32.620 --> 00:17:35.180
Zakenna!

00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:39.640
What's going on here?

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:43.920
This can't be happening! No way! No Way!

00:17:54.410 --> 00:17:58.090
Are you ready for your final curtain now/

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:11.030
Aren't those the visitors who 
were turned into stone statues?

00:18:24.390 --> 00:18:27.280
If you use excessive force 
and break the stone statues,

00:18:27.280 --> 00:18:29.710
you know what will happen 
to the people, don't you?

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:32.290
How could you...? You coward!

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:35.090
Say anything you want.

00:18:35.350 --> 00:18:36.820
Get him mepo!

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:41.600
If you defeat him, then the 
power of evil will disappear.

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:44.720
Try it if you can!

00:19:04.840 --> 00:19:05.890
It's no good!

00:19:06.530 --> 00:19:09.270
He moves too fast. I can't keep up.

00:19:09.270 --> 00:19:12.300
And besides, that tornado is in the way.

00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:14.860
Close your eyes, and feel 
with your hearts mipo!

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:17.760
Close our eyes...?

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:24.650
...feel with our hearts!

00:19:31.860 --> 00:19:33.120
Feel...

00:19:34.010 --> 00:19:35.460
...the sinister heart.

00:19:36.910 --> 00:19:39.320
Black Thunder!

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:41.100
White Thunder!

00:19:54.280 --> 00:19:57.060
The beautiful souls of Pretty Cure...!

00:19:57.430 --> 00:20:00.010
...will crush the sinister hearts!

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:01.670
Are you crazy?

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:03.830
If you do that, the stone statues will 
be entangled in the line of fire!

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:08.350
Pretty Cure Marble Screw!

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:19.360
What?

00:20:19.590 --> 00:20:20.570
We won't let you get away!

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:23.680
It can't be!

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:44.050
Gomenna! Gomenna! Gomenna!

00:20:45.270 --> 00:20:47.210
You did it mepo!

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:54.260
Where did Kashiwada-san go?

00:21:00.410 --> 00:21:01.570
Mayu!

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:03.810
Kashiwada-san?

00:21:03.810 --> 00:21:05.460
How can that be?

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:11.710
Kashiwada-san... We just saw you...

00:21:14.550 --> 00:21:18.640
I wonder what happened to me. 
I don't remember anything.

00:21:19.020 --> 00:21:23.580
But I had a dream... A 
really wonderful dream!

00:21:24.070 --> 00:21:27.640
I was watching the shooting 
stars together with Piccarini.

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:32.470
Then suddenly, one of them flew this way,

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:35.590
and hit Piccarini right on the head.

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:39.580
I'm sorry... but I really enjoyed it.

00:21:41.240 --> 00:21:44.480
Piccarini saved you.

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:47.580
This is what you call a miracle.

00:21:48.500 --> 00:21:49.550
What are you talking about?

00:21:49.970 --> 00:21:51.830
Never mind... never mind.

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:54.850
Let's go to the bus. Everyone's waiting.

00:21:53.760 --> 00:21:57.660
Mayu

00:22:03.230 --> 00:22:06.770
This is the first time we've 
seen that piece, isn't it?

00:22:06.770 --> 00:22:08.130
It's magnificent.

00:22:08.130 --> 00:22:10.060
What a novel pose.

00:22:10.060 --> 00:22:12.200
It's a masterpiece.

